  <History Date="03-03-20" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Pro Light LT Pixel Wash 300 (poor documentation.  effecitvely identical.  HSI has 'Speed' on offset 14 with nothing on 12 or 13.  GUI is missing 14.  assumed error where is part of GUI)" Version="7" />
